.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JqWhJPPqE1IQ7kNvwEfPVoI&_nc_oc=AdqXfMDXNMNWww_9goFW_CFdFO5_-RxD7IsRY49dfOAsPd_xiukrHGomB1fRnZwFpaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2F3DgrIu6EAVRmjQtS7tsKsLCRRz9NdarV-d-bK4G8KA&oe=69F205AC"}, "display_name": "Salmon Man", "keywords": ["rage", "paddle", "speedrun", "platformer", "salmon"], "long_description": "Salmon Man is A hardcore VR platformer that will push your skills, patience, and sanity to the limit.\n\n\ud83d\udc1f**Armed with a Paddle**\\\nClimb upstream with nothing but your paddle to explore a world full of wonder, beauty, and absurdity\u2026 but don\u2019t expect it to go easy on you.\n\n{1125088356495400}\n\n\ud83d\udc80**No Shortcuts. No Mercy.**\\\nOne slip can send you crashing all the way back down, forcing you to try, fail, cry, and try again. Every swing of your paddle is both your lifeline and your greatest risk. Master it, and you\u2019ll conquer the river.\n\n{784643361039146}\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 **A True Test of Will**\\\nWhether you play for the climb, the challenge, or the speedrun glory, Salmon Man isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s a test of will.\n\n{824870547158215}", "short_description": "Salmon Man is a unique VR platformer where armed with nothing but a paddle, you will climb upstream and explore a beautiful, absurd world filled with humor, physics-based challenges, and rage-inducing obstacles."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/Valem-Studio/SalmonManPrivacyPolicies/blob/main/Privacy%20Policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Studio Chipo y Juan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://valemstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQU